  "shortDescription": "A 300 ml vitamin-rich body lotion that repairs dry, rough skin and keeps it soft and smooth, in five vitamin formulas.",
  "description": "<p>Fennel Body Lotion Vitamin Series is a 300 ml everyday body lotion that brings deep moisture to dry, rough skin. Each formula is packed with antioxidant vitamins that help skin hold on to moisture and feel noticeably softer and smoother.</p><p>The lotion forms a light protective layer against moisture loss and leaves skin comfortable without any greasy feel. With regular use, skin looks healthier and feels smoother, with fine lines appearing softer.</p><p>Choose the formula that suits your skin: <strong>Vitamin A</strong> for fine lines and wrinkles, <strong>Vitamin B Complex</strong> for a healthy glow and moisture retention, <strong>Vitamin C</strong> to help repair sun-stressed skin, <strong>Vitamin D</strong> to replenish moisture and help prevent scarring, and <strong>Vitamin E</strong> to repair dry, rough skin.</p>",
